	(text "U1101 holds, in HDL:\n- range register R0..R3, step up and jump\n  from the comparators, step down on a\n  RANGE_DOWN pulse, lock to RANGE_SET;\n- one-hot gate outputs with about 1 us of\n  make-before-break, multiplexer address;\n- fault latch (over-current, VIN_OV, loss\n  of PWR_GOOD), cleared by FAULT_CLR;\n- mode interlock: break before make;\n- 16-bit side-data shift register, loaded\n  by ACQ_WS and shifted by ACQ_BCLK;\n- pass-through of SPI and ADC clocks,\n  gated by PWR_GOOD.\nReset: R3 selected, all switches open.\nBlank device: pins float with weak\npull-ups; the gate drivers have 1 k\npull-downs, so every switch stays open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce501859-3efb-5b07-a37a-35a03427edbf")
	)
